  "detectors": {
    "impeccable": {
      "mappingBasis": "Rule IDs from the Impeccable detector registry (local copy 1fe9c41, 45 rules). Rules Elle lists without a known ID stay unmapped; a run supplying only known IDs covers only those rules."
    }
  },
  "policy": {
    "flagPoints": 2,
    "advisoryPoints": 1,
    "advisoryRequiresAdjudication": true,
    "repeatCountsOncePerCriterion": true,
    "aiTellOriginality": {
      "criterion": "ORIGINALITY",
      "minimumFlags": 3,
      "capPoints": 5
    },
    "gateCap": 49,
    "multiCriterionCharging": "each-mapped-criterion",
    "unresolved": [
      "Multi-criterion rules charge each mapped criterion, read from \"a rule firing many times counts once per criterion\". Confirm that a two-criterion flag costs 2 points in each.",
      "Order of Layer 3 deductions and the Originality cap is unspecified. When the two orders give different points, the criterion is reported unknown.",
      "No zero floor is specified. A criterion whose deductions exceed its raw points is reported unknown, not clamped.",
      "Layer 3 deductions can overlap a defect the visual judge already penalized under Layers 1/2; the source supersedes one-defect-one-criterion, so no deduplication is applied.",
      "Four off-system rules are listed as \"Flag / Advisory\" without a split; they deduct nothing until resolved.",
      "Typography thresholds conflict: criterion 9 warns above about five text sizes, the craft kit allows 6 to 8; criterion 9 sets a 16 px body minimum, Layer 3 flags body under 12 px and UI text under 11 px; the craft kit wants 50 to 75 characters per line, Layer 3 flags over about 80.",
      "Style flags describe patterns. They never establish AI authorship."
    ]
  },
